# Game API lookup

- Excerpts: `ref/oni-api/` — start at `INDEX.md`.
- DLL: `E:\Steam\steamapps\common\OxygenNotIncluded\OxygenNotIncluded_Data\Managed\Assembly-CSharp.dll`
- Missing type: `python ref/oni-api/scan_dll.py TypeName`, then save a focused snippet into `ref/oni-api/` and update `INDEX.md`.
- Do not write new dumps to `%TEMP%\oni-dump`. Do not check in a full Assembly-CSharp decompile.
